    <rigor-reason>Edits the SHARED `Services/Communication/` persist path (`CommunicationService.cs` send + the inbound capture persist) that email-r4 shipped and R1 extended — a frozen, correctness-critical write seam. Adds a new Dataverse write (junction rows) that MUST be best-effort/non-fatal and must not double-write or orphan. `.cs` BFF code (publish-size + CVE + Placement Justification); `parallel-safe:false` (serializes the shared edit); code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5 UNCONDITIONALLY.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>W5</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits the shared `Services/Communication/` persist path (`CommunicationService.cs` outbound persist ~lines 689-727 + the inbound capture persist) that email-r4 owns and R1 extended. MUST NOT run concurrently with 070 (auto-threading, same shared area) or any other BFF writer. Characterization-test existing email/messaging send + capture flows and keep them green BEFORE extending. `/conflict-check` before the PR.</parallel-reason>
