      <pattern name="Persist-point write (message grain)" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/CommunicationService.cs">
        After the `sprk_communication` message persists (outbound ~lines 689-727; inbound capture persist), enumerate From/To/Cc/Bcc, resolve each, and write one junction row per (message × person/address × role). Best-effort/non-fatal, idempotent per message.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Best-effort/non-fatal derived write" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/CommunicationService.cs">
        Mirror R1 enrichment discipline: the derived write is wrapped so a failure is logged/deferred and never surfaces as a send failure or drops a captured message.
